{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"22938","name":"NH Madrid Chamberí","description":"The NH Madrid Chamberí hotel, formerly known as NH Bretón, is in the Chamberí district of Madrid - a charming spot with some of the best gastronomic choices in the city, lovely tapas bars, trendy shops, and a leafy park. Paseo de la Castellana, the city's financial and business corridor, is only five minutes away on foot, so the location is also perfect for business travelers. For access to Madrid's city center, hop on the metro at one of the many nearby stops, such as Alonso Cano or Gregorio Marañon, and be there in just 20 minutes. NH Madrid Chamberí has 56 rooms that let in lots of natural light and feature a classic decor with sleek hardwood floors. Each room comes equipped with free Wi-Fi. An extensive breakfast buffet is served each morning in our cozy breakfast room. The varied spread features classic continental breakfast choices alongside local favorites such as churros with hot chocolate and Spanish omelets. While we don't have an on-site restaurant, guests will find a delightful variety of dining options just steps away from the hotel.","address":"Calle De Breton De Los Herreros, 29","city":"MADRID","countryCode":"ES","postalCode":"28003","lat":40.439613,"lng":-3.698243,"stars":3,"chain":"NH","giataCode":"60793","phone":"+914428300","email":"nhbreton@nh-hotels.com","website":"www.nh-hotels.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/02/022938/022938a_hb_a_916.jpg?20250107173409?20250624011616","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/02/022938/022938a_hb_a_917_20251126_192158.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/02/022938/022938a_hb_a_918_20251126_192200.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/02/022938/022938a_hb_a_919_20251126_192202.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds